OL,3,GNEWSASinfield completes final
OL,4,Aultramarathon challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Kevin Sinfield has completed his
OL,7,Flatest endurance challenge raising
OL,8,Fmoney for motor neurone disease (MND)
OL,9,Fcauses in memory of his friend and
OL,10,Fteammate Rob Burrow, who died in 2024.
OL,12,FSinfield completed seven ultramarathons
OL,13,Fin seven days, crossing the finish line
OL,14,Fat Old Trafford Stadium in Manchester
OL,15,Fahead of the Super League Grand Final.
OL,17,FThe fundraiser and his team have raised
OL,18,Fmore than #13m for the MND community
OL,19,Fsince his first annual challenge in
OL,20,F2020.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
